      ++ "strength, produces any whole-only pattern. Zero in, zero out, always.\n\n"
      ++ "NEVER DOWNWARD. Start instead with the three-coin pattern: whole-only pattern, every "
      ++ "pair exactly flat. Push it through any three private noises you like. The habit may "
      ++ "decay, and generally does — but the decay never deposits pairwise correlation. Every pair of "
      ++ "the result is still exactly flat. What is lost from the whole does not reappear in the "
      ++ "pairs; it is simply gone.\n\n"
